":3591079,"name":"Sébastien Adenis"},{"id":2371861,"name":"Marie Morice"},{"id":3591094,"name":"Farès Sebhi"},{"id":3591105,"name":"Mehdi Sebhi"},{"id":3591112,"name":"Redouane Sebhi"},{"id":3027480,"name":"Bilel Chikri"},{"id":3591145,"name":"Mamadou Coulibaly"},{"id":2531747,"name":"Sidy Koita"},{"id":1768055,"name":"Amara Ly"},{"id":2531746,"name":"Sambaké Madoualy"},{"id":3591160,"name":"Issa Siby"},{"id":3591169,"name":"Siyakha Traoré"},{"id":2533484,"name":"Magalie Combes"},{"id":78207,"name":"Romain Gavras","role":"Mayor's Henchman (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fdYJW1NoKKrwa5l6RLEsbdnruKE.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"I miserabili","overview":"Stéphane è da poco entrato nella squadra anticrimine di Montfermeil, alla periferia di Parigi. Insieme ai nuovi colleghi Chris e Gwada, entrambi più esperti di lui, scopre rapidamente che esistono varie tensioni tra le gang del quartiere. Alle prese con un arresto non facile, un drone cattura ogni loro mossa e azione."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Stéphane has recently joined the Anti-Crime Squad in Montfermeil, in the suburbs of Paris, France, where Victor Hugo set his famed novel “Les Miserables”. Alongside his new colleagues Chris and Gwada – both experienced members of the team – he quickly discovers tensions running high between local gangs. When the trio finds themselves overrun during the course of an arrest, a drone captures the encounter, threatening to expose the reality of everyday life."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Stéphane, tout juste arrivé de Cherbourg, intègre la brigade anti‐criminalité de Montfermeil, dans le 93. Il va faire la rencontre de ses nouveaux coéquipiers, Chris et Gwada, deux « bacqueux » d’expérience. Il découvre rapidement les tensions entre les différents groupes du quartier. Alors qu’ils se trouvent débordés lors d’une interpellation, un drone filme leurs moindres faits et gestes…"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rgwvcVYc4FxRkBcWrCo2k1TQZIm.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgwvcVYc4FxRkBcWrCo2k1TQZIm.png","language":"fr","width":3802,"height":1223},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Kw0F4dLvMMpc9qGO1XfVvy5Mvj.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4Kw0F4dLvMMpc9qGO1XfVvy5Mvj.png","language":"fr","width":734,"height":298},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pyI5l37qrJVbgkoRLmwBHUrCUVW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pyI5l37qrJVbgkoRLmwBHUrCUVW.png","language":"fr","width":731,"height":294},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iiOeYfHR5g1gcHU6U2qYGMuteq7.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iiOeYfHR5g1gcHU6U2qYGMuteq7.png","language":"fr","width":3802,"height":1223}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2O6bM9XjIOK43ZiwiRHbjB3GMud.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2O6bM9XjIOK43ZiwiRHbjB3GMud.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z2PwTteOiQhgSVtvcWWRj5ergqw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z2PwTteOiQhgSVtvcWWRj5ergqw.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lugo5nXpBewVoBa2k9SMwtF06wZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lugo5nXpBewVoBa2k9SMwtF06wZ.jpg","language":"it","width":532,"height":798},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ZQV9rPFXF0iFfKbsAvVIweQ1yM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ZQV9rPFXF0iFfKbsAvVIweQ1yM.jpg","language":"en","width":1024,"height":1492},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1uaj1chdDtkKsyXbLK0Bi8RDG2N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1uaj1chdDtkKsyXbLK0Bi8RDG2N.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url"